      "parameters": {
        "content": "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n### Configure your workflow here\n1. `apiKey` - Your API key for [News API](https://newsapi.org)\n2. `newsAge` - How old should news be, in days\n3. `maxArticles` - Number of articles that will be sent, max 100\n4. `emails`- List of email addresses that should receive the news, separated by commas\n\n\nকোন API দিয়ে খবর আনবে, কত দিনের খবর, কয়টা খবর, আর কাদের ইমেইলে পাঠাবে",
        "height": 559
      },
